===Etymology===
From {{etyl|de|en}} {{term|autologisch|lang=de}}, from {{etyl|grc|en}} {{term|αὐτός||self|tr=autos|lang=grc|sc=polytonic}} + {{term|λόγος||word|tr=logos|lang=grc|sc=polytonic}}.

