* {{a|RP}} {{IPA|/ˌɔː.təʊˈlɒ.dʒɪ.kəl/|/ˌɔː.təˈlɒ.dʒɪ.kəl/|lang=en}}
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|/ˌɑːtoʊˈlɑːdʒɪkəl/|/ˌɑːtəˈlɑːdʒɪkəl/|lang=en}}
* {{audio|en-us-autological.ogg|Audio (US)|lang=en}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# {{context|grammar|lang=en}} Of a [[phrase]] (especially an [[adjective]]), possessing the property it describes.
#: ''The word ''polysyllabic'' is '''autological''', but the word ''monosyllabic'' is not.''
#: ''Because the word ''short'' is in fact short, it is considered '''autological'''.''
#: ''The word ''noun'' is itself a noun, and is thus '''autological'''.''

